pageType: content
background:
  type: image
  src: "media/template-inner.png"
  fit: {mode: cover}
elements:
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [58, 44, 820, 48]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: 案例一关键实现｜企业 Key 领域模型与安全映射
  - elementId: lead
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 100, 840, 30]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      text: 领域模型把兼容性、组织关系、来源追踪和安全展示固化为可复用数据契约。
  - elementId: code-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 148, 540, 282]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$ink"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$ink"}
  - elementId: code
    elementType: text
    bounds: [76, 162, 508, 254]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Consolas"
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "$white"
      lineHeight: 1.22
      text: |
        export interface EnterpriseKeyBinding {
          apiKey: string;
          apiKeyHash: string;
          userName: string;
          email?: string;
          departmentId: string;
          source: 'import' | 'manual';
          departmentResolvedBy: 'csv' | 'manual';
        }

        export interface EnterpriseKeyMetadata {
          apiKeyHash: string;
          userName: string;
          email?: string;
          departmentId: string;
        }
  - elementId: r-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 148, 260, 30]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      text: IMPLEMENTATION POINTS
  - elementId: r
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 188, 260, 214]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      text: |
        <p><strong>兼容层</strong>：apiKey 保留原有 CPA 管理与调用语义。</p>
        <p><strong>关联层</strong>：apiKeyHash 作为配额、审计与 Analytics 的稳定连接键。</p>
        <p><strong>来源层</strong>：区分 CSV 导入与人工修正，支持历史解释。</p>
        <p><strong>展示层</strong>：页面只读取非秘密 metadata 与安全掩码。</p>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 464, 840, 20]
    content:
      style: "$bodySmall"
      fontSize: 11
      text: 代码位置：src/types/enterpriseKey.ts、src/services/api/enterpriseKeys.ts、useEnterpriseKeyStore.ts。
